00:22:18.227 --> 00:22:20.097
And then found himself
wanted for killings

00:22:20.258 --> 00:22:22.177
He claimed were the work
of an invisible force,

00:22:22.761 --> 00:22:24.174
Killings carried
out --Get this --

00:22:24.669 --> 00:22:25.838
With a sharp instrument.

00:22:26.027 --> 00:22:27.129
What's the connection to lori?

00:22:27.739 --> 00:22:30.955
A man of religion who openly
preaches against immorality.

00:22:32.387 --> 00:22:35.009
Except this time instead
of saving the whole town,

00:22:35.009 --> 00:22:36.673
He's trying to save his only daughter.

00:22:36.673 --> 00:22:37.909
Reverend sorenson.

00:22:38.567 --> 00:22:39.874
Do you think he's summoning the spirit?

00:22:40.362 --> 00:22:41.052
Maybe.

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:44.928
Or you know how a poltergeist

00:22:44.928 --> 00:22:46.664
Can haunt a person instead of a place?

00:22:47.079 --> 00:22:49.470
The spirit latches onto the
reverend's repressed emotions,

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:50.302
Feeds off them.

00:22:52.138 --> 00:22:53.870
Without the reverend
ever even knowing it.

00:22:56.178 --> 00:22:58.565
Either way,  you should
keep an eye on lori tonight.

00:22:59.179 --> 00:23:00.109
What about you?

00:23:06.036 --> 00:23:07.969
I'm gonna go see if I can
find that unmarked grave.

00:24:07.814 --> 00:24:09.713
Here we go.

00:24:46.950 --> 00:24:48.158
That's it.

00:24:48.744 --> 00:24:52.431
Next time,  I get to watch
the cute girl's house.

00:25:06.578 --> 00:25:07.892
Hello,  preacher.

00:25:25.415 --> 00:25:28.020
I saw you from upstairs.

00:25:29.402 --> 00:25:30.884
What are you doing here?

00:25:32.746 --> 00:25:34.649
I'm keeping an eye on the place.

00:25:37.407 --> 00:25:38.764
I was worried.

00:25:38.764 --> 00:25:39.974
About me?

00:25:40.146 --> 00:25:41.839
Yeah,  sorry.

00:25:43.480 --> 00:25:44.760
No,  it's cool.

00:25:46.357 --> 00:25:47.562
I already called the cops.

00:25:50.244 --> 00:25:52.603
No,  seriously, I think you're sweet,

00:25:53.450 --> 00:25:56.139
Which is probably why you
should run away from me

00:25:56.139 --> 00:25:57.402
As fast as you can.

00:25:59.467 --> 00:26:00.882
Why would you say that?

00:26:01.951 --> 00:26:03.699
It's like I'm cursed or something.

00:26:04.438 --> 00:26:06.219
People around me keep dying.

00:26:10.364 --> 00:26:11.852
I thinkI know how you feel.

00:26:38.929 --> 00:26:40.323
Goodbye,  preacher.

00:26:53.237 --> 00:26:54.811
No one will talk to me anymore...

00:26:55.731 --> 00:26:56.812
Except you.

00:26:57.300 --> 00:26:59.099
The sheriff thinks I'm a suspect.

00:27:00.217 --> 00:27:01.581
And you know what my dad will say?

00:27:01.650 --> 00:27:03.473
"Pave faith."

00:27:03.785 --> 00:27:05.636
What does he know about faith?

00:27:08.447 --> 00:27:10.221
I heard you guys fighting before.

00:27:11.966 --> 00:27:15.398
He's seeing a woman, a married woman.

00:27:15.581 --> 00:27:16.871
I just found out.

00:27:18.189 --> 00:27:20.354
She comes to our
church with her husband,

00:27:20.698 --> 00:27:22.290
I know her kids,

00:27:22.815 --> 00:27:26.263
And he talks to me about
religion, about morality?

00:27:27.999 --> 00:27:29.614
It's like on one hand, you know,

00:27:30.354 --> 00:27:31.897
Just do what you want and be happy,

00:27:32.729 --> 00:27:34.878
But he
taught me --

00:27:34.996 --> 00:27:38.076
Raised me to believe that
if you do something wrong,

00:27:38.156 --> 00:27:39.286
You will get punished.

00:27:43.351 --> 00:27:45.550
I just don't know what to think anymore.

00:28:14.665 --> 00:28:15.672
Sam?

00:28:16.229 --> 00:28:17.924
Lori,  I can'T.

00:28:19.755 --> 00:28:21.600
That someone you lost?

00:28:25.584 --> 00:28:27.129
I'm sorry.

00:28:27.260 --> 00:28:27.976
Lori.

00:28:30.436 --> 00:28:32.271
Come inside,  please.

00:28:33.311 --> 00:28:35.047
I'll come in when I'm ready.

00:28:37.536 --> 00:28:39.411
Ack! Aah!

00:28:47.157 --> 00:28:48.746
No! No!

00:29:04.366 --> 00:29:05.195
Dad!

00:29:11.403 --> 00:29:12.948
It's okay.It's all right.

00:29:12.948 --> 00:29:14.404
It's okay. It's okay.

00:29:17.942 --> 00:29:18.937
We were just talking.

00:29:19.540 --> 00:29:23.285
Then lori's dad came
out, and then he appeared.

00:29:23.667 --> 00:29:27.227
A big man carrying a
weapon,  some kind of a hook?

00:29:27.432 --> 00:29:28.460
Yes,  sir.

00:29:29.198 --> 00:29:30.374
Ever seen him before?

00:29:32.254 --> 00:29:33.095
No,  sir.

00:29:34.842 --> 00:29:37.178
Son,  it seems every time I
turn around,  I'm seeing you.

00:29:39.099 --> 00:29:40.786
I suggest you try to
stay out of trouble.

00:29:42.430 --> 00:29:43.225
Yes,  sir.

00:29:44.199 --> 00:29:45.365
It's all right.I'm with him.

00:29:45.381 --> 00:29:48.030
That's my brother.Hey,  brother.

00:29:52.217 --> 00:29:53.257
Let him through.

00:29:53.589 --> 00:29:54.748
Thanks.

00:29:57.186 --> 00:29:58.165
Go ahead.

00:30:02.787 --> 00:30:03.264
You okay?

00:30:03.264 --> 00:30:03.809
Yeah.

00:30:04.336 --> 00:30:05.345
What the hell happened?

00:30:05.805 --> 00:30:06.606
Hookman.

00:30:06.959 --> 00:30:07.729
You saw him?

00:30:07.766 --> 00:30:08.538
Damn right.

00:30:08.712 --> 00:30:09.653
Why didn't you torch the bones?

00:30:09.653 --> 00:30:13.294
I did. Are you sure it's
the spirit of jacob karns?

00:30:13.294 --> 00:30:15.956
Sure as hell looked like
him. And that's not all.

00:30:16.294 --> 00:30:18.311
I don't think the spirit is
latching onto the reverend.

00:30:18.601 --> 00:30:20.720
Yeah,  the guy wouldn't send
the hookman after himself.

00:30:23.567 --> 00:30:25.088
I think it's latching onto lori.

00:30:25.832 --> 00:30:27.337
Last night she found out that her father

00:30:27.337 --> 00:30:29.186
Is having an affair
with a married woman.

00:30:29.342 --> 00:30:30.326
So what?

00:30:30.326 --> 00:30:31.390
So,  she's upset about it.

00:30:31.838 --> 00:30:33.655
She's upset about the immorality of it.

00:30:33.996 --> 00:30:35.428
She was raised to believe

00:30:35.428 --> 00:30:37.404
That if you do something
wrong, you get punished.

00:30:38.149 --> 00:30:39.853
Okay,  so she's conflicted,

00:30:40.164 --> 00:30:41.694
And the spirit of preacher karns

00:30:41.694 --> 00:30:43.248
Is latching onto her emotions

00:30:43.248 --> 00:30:44.733
And doing the punishing for her.

00:30:44.909 --> 00:30:45.772
Right.

00:30:46.113 --> 00:30:47.533
Rich comes on too strong.

00:30:47.703 --> 00:30:49.552
Taylor tries to make
her into a party girl.

00:30:50.122 --> 00:30:51.389
Dad has an affair.

00:30:52.099 --> 00:30:53.714
Remind me not to piss this girl off.

00:30:55.895 --> 00:30:57.938
But I burned those bones.I
buried them in salt.

00:30:58.190 --> 00:30:59.323
Why didn't that stop him?

00:31:00.637 --> 00:31:02.013
You must've missed something.

00:31:03.695 --> 00:31:05.655
No,  I burned everything in that coffin.

00:31:07.019 --> 00:31:08.247
Did you get the hook?

00:31:10.097 --> 00:31:10.897
The hook?

00:31:12.641 --> 00:31:13.662
It was the murder weapon,

00:31:13.839 --> 00:31:15.614
And in a way it was part of him.

00:31:18.515 --> 00:31:19.846
So,  like the bones,

00:31:19.846 --> 00:31:21.342
The hook is a source of his power.

00:31:22.327 --> 00:31:23.801
So,  if we find the hook...

00:31:24.070 --> 00:31:25.694
We stop the hookman.

00:31:33.795 --> 00:31:34.975
Here's something, I think.

00:31:36.490 --> 00:31:38.342
Log book, iowa state penitentiary.

00:31:38.342 --> 00:31:39.403
"Karns,
jacob --

00:31:39.403 --> 00:31:41.701
Personal affects, disposition there of."

00:31:41.701 --> 00:31:42.564
Does it mention the hook?

00:31:44.345 --> 00:31:46.847
"Upon execution,  all earthly
items shall be remanded

00:31:46.847 --> 00:31:48.082
"To the prisoner's houseof worship,

00:31:48.247 --> 00:31:49.504
St. Barnabas church."

00:31:50.953 --> 00:31:52.541
Isn't that where lori's father preaches?

00:31:52.541 --> 00:31:53.076
Yeah.

00:31:54.368 --> 00:31:55.501
Where lori lives?

00:31:56.079 --> 00:31:57.944
That's why the hookman'sbeen
haunting reverends

00:31:57.944 --> 00:32:00.095
And reverends' daughters
for the past 200 years.

00:32:00.095 --> 00:32:02.157
But if the hook were at
the church or lori's house,

00:32:02.157 --> 00:32:03.453
Don't you think someone
might've seen it?

00:32:03.830 --> 00:32:06.406
I mean,  a blood-Stained,
silver-Handled hook?

00:32:08.441 --> 00:32:09.581
Check the church records.

00:32:12.130 --> 00:32:14.614
"St. Barnabas donations, 1862.

00:32:14.614 --> 00:32:16.285
"Received
--Silver-Handled hook

00:32:16.439 --> 00:32:17.737
"From state penitentiary.

00:32:18.857 --> 00:32:19.624
Reforged."

00:32:21.126 --> 00:32:24.083
They melted it down, made
it into something else.

00:32:39.021 --> 00:32:40.417
All right.We can't take any chances.

00:32:40.417 --> 00:32:41.856
Anything silver goes in the fire.

00:32:42.211 --> 00:32:43.208
I agree.

00:32:44.282 --> 00:32:45.492
Lori's still at the hospital.

00:32:45.492 --> 00:32:46.508
We'll have to break in.

00:32:46.891 --> 00:32:47.974
All right, take your pick.

00:32:48.694 --> 00:32:49.575
I'll take the house.

00:32:50.056 --> 00:32:50.624
Okay.

00:32:53.316 --> 00:32:54.300
Hey.

00:32:55.912 --> 00:32:57.368
Stay out of her underwear drawer.

00:33:15.106 --> 00:33:16.864
I got everything that even looks silver.

00:33:16.864 --> 00:33:17.903
Better safe than sorry.

00:33:32.871 --> 00:33:33.694
Move,  move.

00:34:07.778 --> 00:34:08.643
Lori?

00:34:10.436 --> 00:34:11.706
What are you doing here?

00:34:11.706 --> 00:34:12.547
What is it?

00:34:13.763 --> 00:34:17.676
I've been trying to understand
what's been happening,  why.

00:34:18.023 --> 00:34:20.835
Now I know,  so I'm
praying for forgiveness.

00:34:21.746 --> 00:34:23.310
Forgiveness for what?

00:34:23.785 --> 00:34:24.983
Don't you see?

00:34:25.058 --> 00:34:26.768
I'm to blame for all this.

00:34:27.607 --> 00:34:30.704
I've read in the bible
about avenging angels.

00:34:30.782 --> 00:34:31.190
Trust me.

00:34:31.190 --> 00:34:34.469
This guy --
He's no angel.

00:34:35.403 --> 00:34:37.797
I was so angry at my father.

00:34:38.517 --> 00:34:40.461
Part of me wanted him punished,

00:34:41.695 --> 00:34:43.861
And then he came and he punished him.

00:34:44.075 --> 00:34:45.442
It's not your fault.

00:34:45.946 --> 00:34:47.177
Yes,  it is.

00:34:47.619 --> 00:34:49.179
I don't know how, but it is.

00:34:51.541 --> 00:34:52.582
I killed rich.

00:34:52.924 --> 00:34:53.936
Taylor,  too.

00:34:54.337 --> 00:34:55.929
I nearly killed my father.

00:34:56.363 --> 00:34:57.035
Lori.

00:34:59.131 --> 00:35:00.265
I can see it now.

00:35:01.317 --> 00:35:03.011
They didn't deserve to be punished.

00:35:03.381 --> 00:35:04.245
I do.

00:35:16.147 --> 00:35:17.871
Come on.We got to go.

00:35:27.170 --> 00:35:27.872
Go!

00:35:29.505 --> 00:35:30.234
Come on!

00:35:51.397 --> 00:35:52.182
No!

00:36:01.431 --> 00:36:03.144
Come on,  get up.

00:36:17.913 --> 00:36:18.960
Sam,  drop!

00:36:25.313 --> 00:36:26.620
I thought we got all the silver.

00:36:27.379 --> 00:36:28.482
Why is he still here?

00:36:28.517 --> 00:36:29.868
Maybe we missed something.

00:36:32.776 --> 00:36:34.494
Lori,  where did you getthat chain?

00:36:35.103 --> 00:36:36.280
My father gave it to me.

00:36:36.408 --> 00:36:37.294
Where'd your dad get it?

00:36:37.296 --> 00:36:39.183
It was a church
heirloom.He gave it to me.

00:36:39.916 --> 00:36:40.630
Is it silver?

00:36:40.630 --> 00:36:41.110
Yes.

00:36:58.497 --> 00:36:59.196
Sam.

00:38:09.745 --> 00:38:12.380
And you saw him,  too,
the man with the hook?

00:38:12.404 --> 00:38:14.160
Yes,  I told you.We all saw him.

00:38:14.160 --> 00:38:16.017
We fought him off, and then he ran.

00:38:16.569 --> 00:38:17.293
And that's all?

00:38:18.044 --> 00:38:18.853
Yeah,  that's all.

00:38:22.532 --> 00:38:24.669
Listen, you and
your brother --

00:38:24.669 --> 00:38:26.084
Oh,  don't worry.We're leaving town.

00:38:32.933 --> 00:38:34.006
You gonna be okay?

00:38:34.910 --> 00:38:35.855
Yeah.

00:38:45.989 --> 00:38:47.368
I still don't know what happened,

00:38:48.559 --> 00:38:51.399
But I do know you saved my life.

00:38:52.116 --> 00:38:53.275
My father's,  too.

00:38:53.746 --> 00:38:54.581
Thank you.

00:39:20.115 --> 00:39:21.139
We could stay.



